WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.714
Amazon Shipping provides reliable ground delivery service for orders placed on Amazon, your own

00:00:07.714 --> 00:00:11.020
website, and other e-commerce channels.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:17.984
Package pickup and delivery operate seven days a week without additional residential fees or weekend

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:24.020
delivery charges, offering a fast and reliable solution for delivering to your customers.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:30.019
To register for Amazon Shipping, navigate to Shipper Central at ship.

00:00:30.019 --> 00:00:30.564
amazon.

00:00:30.564 --> 00:00:32.200
com/getstarted/home.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:39.000
Click Log in with Amazon and sign in with the same credentials you use to access Seller Central.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.743
Select the Seller Central account you'd like to connect Amazon Shipping to and click continue

00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:47.040
to begin the account setup process.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:50.696
Fill in each of the required sections with your company details

00:00:50.696 --> 00:00:56.020
and the average number of packages you ship each day to calculate your shipping rates.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:01:01.020
Then review our shipping policies and select complete sign up to activate your account.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:07.650
Begin managing your shipping process on the Shipper Central homepage by using the four tabs at the

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:08.040
top.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:12.040
From the booking tab, you'll see orders that are ready to process for shipping.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:13.267
Select one or

00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:19.404
multiple orders, enter the package details, then click the Print Order button to generate the

00:01:19.404 --> 00:01:21.040
shipping label or labels.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.040
After creating your labels, you'll need to schedule a pickup.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:30.895
On the Pickups tab, click the Action button and choose to schedule a one-time pickup or a recurring

00:01:30.895 --> 00:01:33.060
pickup from the drop-down menu.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:38.598
You can also view your pickup schedule as daily, weekly or monthly

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:39.060
calendars.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:44.380
To modify or cancel a pickup, hover over the three lines on the scheduled date you

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:47.040
want to modify and select your desired change.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:50.640
From the Tracking tab, you can view order shipment

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:55.040
details such as the tracking ID and pickup and delivery information.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.307
Last, the Support tab

00:01:56.307 --> 00:02:01.060
allows you to select from a range of topics that you may need help with.

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:02.639
You can choose to chat,

00:02:02.639 --> 00:02:07.060
email or speak with someone from our help team available 24 hours a day.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.218
We recommend uploading

00:02:08.218 --> 00:02:12.080
any support documents that may help resolve your issue faster.

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:14.180
To access other features and support

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:19.080
tools, navigate to the menu bar in the top right corner of the page.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.163
Here, you can access your

00:02:21.163 --> 00:02:24.080
billing information, item catalog and shipping rates.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.973
From settings, you're able to update

00:02:26.973 --> 00:02:33.242
various aspects of your business, such as commonly used package sizes, recipient notifications,

00:02:33.242 --> 00:02:37.100
user permissions, pickup alerts and third-party integrations.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:40.052
If there is a problem with a package,

00:02:40.052 --> 00:02:46.324
you can file, track and manage shipping claims from the shipping claims page or file a claim

00:02:46.324 --> 00:02:51.120
directly from an Order's shipment detail page and clicking the file claim button.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:51.830
For additional

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:57.507
support, access the help page for a list of comprehensive articles and step-by-step instructions

00:02:57.507 --> 00:03:02.120
that can help guide you through each stage of managing your shipments effectively.
